{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerPositive","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerPositive","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerNonneg","lean:module:QOU.Knot.RivinConcavity"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerPositive.blochWigner_lob_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerPositive.blochWigner_lob_pos","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochWignerPositive.lean#L105-L110","doc":"**`0 < D(z)` for every `z` in the upper half plane.**\n\nThe strict general positivity.  Every such `z` is an `IdealTetrahedron` shape by\nconstruction, so this is `volume_pos` read through Milnor's formula. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerPositive.volume_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerPositive.volume_pos","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochWignerPositive.lean#L96-L103","doc":"**An ideal tetrahedron has strictly positive volume.**\n\nSo a nondegenerate ideal tetrahedron is genuinely nondegenerate in volume, not merely\nnonnegative — the statement `MathlibExt/ManifoldVolumeBridge.lean` names as the one it\ndeclines to assume. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerPositive.lob_sum_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerPositive.lob_sum_pos","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochWignerPositive.lean#L53-L94","doc":"**The ideal-tetrahedron `Λ`-sum is strictly positive.**\n\nThree positive angles summing to `π`.  The strict counterpart of\n`LobMonotonicity.lob_sum_nonneg`, and it consumes that lemma rather than strengthening\nit — see the module header. ","signatureChunk":0}]}